==================================================
GITHUB WORKFLOW

Use a professional Git workflow.

For each issue:

Create or use a dedicated branch.

Use descriptive commits.

Example:

fix(messages): prevent duplicate incoming messages

fix(inventory): correct stock status synchronization

perf(chat): virtualize long conversation list

Do not combine unrelated fixes into one large commit.

